AB  - The proceedings contain 580 papers. The special focus in this conference is on Pattern Recognition and Computer Vision,. The topics include: Synthesizing Commercial Floorplans via a Controllable Diffusion Framework; GMDMP: Gaussian Mixture Diffusion Model for Adversarial Purification; A Mamba-KAN Joint UNet Framework for Medical Image Segmentation; SelfMix-CF: Self-mixing Transformation with Central-Flip Enhancement for Adversarial Transferability; scale-aware Multi-head Attention with Explainability for Image Captioning; SADN: Saliency-Based Attention Discrimination Network for Deepfake Detection; DNPrune-GT: Graph Transformer with Dynamic Neighbor Pruning for Knowledge Graph Reasoning; MaSA: Mamba-Based Global Feature Selective Aggregator for Efficient Lane Detection; SEE-Net: Spectral Environment Encoder for Graph Out-of-Distribution Representations Learning; diffusion Transformer-Based Lighting Control and Identity-Preserving Personalization for Single-Person Portraits; dynamic Multi-scale Aggregation for Open-Vocabulary Semantic Segmentation; chain-of-Thought Prompt Optimization of Large Language Models via Generative Adversarial; Boosting CNN Backbones for Crowd Counting via Mamba Learning Paradigm; Kinematic-Prior-Guided Generation of Accurate and Smooth Turning Trajectory for AVs; mixture of Group Experts for Multi-task Dense Prediction; auto-Locate: A Training-Free Multi-instance Generation for Text-to-Image Diffusion Models; modular MeanFlow: Towards Stable and Scalable One-Step Generative Modeling; an Enhanced Federated Prototype Learning Method Under Domain Shift; a Novel Transformer with Decomposition for Multivarite Prediction; CLANet: A Denoising-Driven Framework for Robust mmWave Radar Vital Sign Monitoring; sphereDrag: Spherical Geometry-Aware Panoramic Image Editing; CLoRA: Adversarial-Free Robustness Transfer for Self-supervised Learning; FMVformer: A Filtered Multi-view Transformer for Time Series Forecasting; UDP: A Deep Unfolding Network with Dual Priors for Hyperspectral Image Reconstruction; semantic-Guided Denoising Knowledge Distillation Model for Anomaly Detection; VDIS: Combating Object Hallucination in Multimodal Large Language Models; hadamard Transform Based Backdoor Attack; spikePoint: Efficient 3D Point Cloud Classification with Point-to-Pixel Conversion and Spike-TransResNet; ViT-NAS: Image Manipulation Localization Based on Vision Transformer and Neural Architecture Search; hierarchical Feature Alignment and Disentanglement for Cross-Domain Keyhole Penetration Prediction.
